---
layout: base.njk
---
<section class="intro">
  <h1>Things I'm building</h1>
  <p>I'm Tim, a software engineer in London. I build tools for AI agents, research experiments on how language models behave, and the occasional synth module. These are write-ups of projects once they're done.</p>
</section>

<ol class="post-list">
{% for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
  <li>
    <a class="post-card" href="{{ post.url }}">
      <div class="post-card-text">
        <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
        <h2>{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
        {% if post.data.summary %}<p>{{ post.data.summary }}</p>{% endif %}
      </div>
      {% set thumb = post.data.thumb or post.data.image %}{% if thumb %}<img class="thumb" src="{{ thumb }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{% endif %}
    </a>
  </li>
{% endfor %}
</ol>
